{"n":15,"title":"Who, what, when, where, why","blurb":"Задавать конкретные вопросы","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Who, what, when, where, why","sub":"","html":"<p>Расспроси незнакомца о его любимом здании.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Задавать вопросы с what, where, when</li><li>Спрашивать how many и how often</li><li>Отвечать с because</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Какие вопросы вы знаете?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"What's your name?"},{"label":"Where are you from?"},{"label":"What time is it?"},{"label":"How old are you?"},{"label":"What do you do?"},{"label":"How are you?"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"what","ru":"что / какой","kk":"не / қандай","def":"What music do you like?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-what.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a110e6b9a361.mp3"},{"en":"where","ru":"где / куда","kk":"қайда","def":"Where do you live?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-where.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/46148cc3b4d2.mp3"},{"en":"when","ru":"когда","kk":"қашан","def":"When do the shops close?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/30603fa9e0f6.mp3"},{"en":"who","ru":"кто","kk":"кім","def":"Who is that man?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-who.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b7adf77905f5.mp3"},{"en":"why","ru":"почему","kk":"неге","def":"Why do you like it?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-why.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/10cff4034ced.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините вопросительное слово и ответ.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"Where?","right":"In Almaty."},{"left":"When?","right":"At seven o'clock."},{"left":"Who?","right":"My brother."},{"left":"Why?","right":"Because it's cheap."}],"options":["At seven o'clock.","Because it's cheap.","In Almaty.","My brother."]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"how","ru":"как","kk":"қалай","def":"How do you go to work?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-how.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/0b064373fb4d.mp3"},{"en":"how many","ru":"сколько (штук)","kk":"қанша (дана)","def":"How many children have you got?","img":"/course/a0/img/l20-how-many.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/6d34e27686cd.mp3"},{"en":"how much","ru":"сколько (цена)","kk":"қанша (баға)","def":"How much is a ticket?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/4df45ef0ae87.mp3"},{"en":"how often","ru":"как часто","kk":"қаншалықты жиі","def":"How often do you cook?","img":"/course/a0/img/l15-how-often.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b107bd2c9fdd.mp3"},{"en":"because","ru":"потому что","kk":"өйткені","def":"I like it because it's different.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"children have you got?","answers":["How many"],"bank":["How much","How many","How often"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"is a ticket?","answers":["How much"],"bank":["How","How many","How much"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"do you play football?","answers":["How often"],"bank":["How many","How often","Why"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два вопроса.","sub":"Вопросительное слово стоит первым.","items":[{"text":"Where do you live?","src":null},{"text":"When does your family eat dinner?","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Порядок слов в вопросе","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Слово</th><th>+ do / does</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>Where</td><td>do you</td><td>Where do you live?</td></tr><tr><td>When</td><td>does she</td><td>When does she start work?</td></tr><tr><td>What</td><td>do you</td><td>What music do you like?</td></tr><tr><td>Why</td><td>do people</td><td>Why do people like fashion?</td></tr></table><p>Порядок: <b>вопросительное слово + do/does + лицо + глагол</b>.</p><p>С he, she, it — <b>does</b>, и у глагола нет -s.</p><p>С <b>to be</b> нет do: <b>Where are</b> you from?</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Ответ с because","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Кратко</th><th>Полностью</th></tr><tr><td>Why do you like it?</td><td>Because it's different.</td><td>I like it because it's different.</td></tr><tr><td>Where do you live?</td><td>In Almaty.</td><td>I live in Almaty.</td></tr><tr><td>How often do you cook?</td><td>Every day.</td><td>I cook every day.</td></tr></table><p>Краткий ответ — нормально и вежливо в речи.</p><p>На <b>Why…?</b> отвечают <b>Because…</b></p><p>После вопросительного слова не отвечают <b>Yes</b> или <b>No</b>.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Вопросы с can будут в уроке 16.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Where do you live?","What is your favourite colour?","When do the shops close?","Why do people like fashion?","How many people work here?","Because it's very different."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ do you live?","options":["What","Where","Who"],"answer":"Where","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ does the film start?","options":["When","Why","How many"],"answer":"When","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ is that woman?","options":["What","Where","Who"],"answer":"Who","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Where","after":"she work?","answers":["does"],"bank":["does","is","do"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"do you like this building?","answers":["Why"],"bank":["Who","Why","How much"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Why? —","after":"it's cheap.","answers":["Because"],"bank":["But","And","Because"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"match","title":"Соедините вопрос и ответ.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"What do you do?","right":"I'm a teacher."},{"left":"How often do you cook?","right":"Twice a week."},{"left":"How much is it?","right":"Five euros."},{"left":"Who is she?","right":"She's my sister."}],"options":["I'm a teacher.","Twice a week.","Five euros.","She's my sister."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["you","work?","do","Where"],"answer":"Where do you work?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["does","start","When","work?","she"],"answer":"When does she start work?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["children","have","you","How","got?","many"],"answer":"How many children have you got?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Where","you","do","live?"],"bad":1,"answer":"Where do you live?","why":"do ставится перед лицом."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["When","does","she","starts","work?"],"bad":3,"answer":"When does she start work?","why":"После does у глагола нет -s."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Where","do","you","are","from?"],"bad":1,"answer":"Where are you from?","why":"С are do не нужен."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какой вопрос вы слышите?","src":"/course/a0/audio/d550f7652db7.mp3","options":["Where do you work?","Where do you live?","What do you do?"],"answer":"Where do you live?","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какое вопросительное слово?","src":"/course/a0/audio/ba6388b76658.mp3","options":["When","Why","Where"],"answer":"When","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните вопрос.","sub":"","before":"","after":"do people like fashion?","answers":["Why"],"bank":["Why","When","Who"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/9db070eb50f5.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какой вопрос вы слышите?","src":"/course/a0/audio/cd14cdbb58c8.mp3","options":["What music do you like?","When does your family eat dinner?","Where do you buy your clothes?"],"answer":"When does your family eat dinner?","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Как называется здание?","src":"/course/a0/audio/59882ec16dc1.mp3","options":["the Shard","the Gherkin","the Plaza"],"answer":"the Gherkin","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Что там делают люди?","src":"/course/a0/audio/59882ec16dc1.mp3","options":["They work.","They live.","They study."],"answer":"They work.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","before":"— Why do you like it? —","after":"it's very different.","answers":["Because"],"bank":["Because","But","And"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/f0e5ac262b36.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Лену.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Lena</p><p>Hi! I'm Lena. I'm a guide in Almaty.</p><p>People ask me a lot of questions every day.</p><p>Where is the museum? When does it open? How much is a ticket?</p><p>My favourite question is: Why do you like your job? Because I meet people.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Lena is a guide.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Lena</p><p>Hi! I'm Lena. I'm a guide in Almaty.</p><p>People ask me a lot of questions every day.</p><p>Where is the museum? When does it open? How much is a ticket?</p><p>My favourite question is: Why do you like your job? Because I meet people.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"People never ask her questions.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Lena</p><p>Hi! I'm Lena. I'm a guide in Almaty.</p><p>People ask me a lot of questions every day.</p><p>Where is the museum? When does it open? How much is a ticket?</p><p>My favourite question is: Why do you like your job? Because I meet people.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Почему ей нравится работа?","options":["Because it's easy.","Because she meets people.","Because it's near."],"answer":"Because she meets people.","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Lena</p><p>Hi! I'm Lena. I'm a guide in Almaty.</p><p>People ask me a lot of questions every day.</p><p>Where is the museum? When does it open? How much is a ticket?</p><p>My favourite question is: Why do you like your job? Because I meet people.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите три вопроса.","sub":"Вопросы новому коллеге.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>Where ___ ?</li><li>How often ___ ?</li><li>Why ___ ?</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Where</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">When</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Why</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">How often</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">How many</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">do you</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">does he</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">live</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">work</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">cook</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Каждый вопрос начинается с вопросительного слова.</li><li>После него я поставил(а) <b>do</b> или <b>does</b>.</li><li>После <b>does</b> у глагола нет <b>-s</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите вопросы. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"В вопросе интонация идёт вверх.","items":["Where do you live?","When does the film start?","How often do you cook?","Why do you like it?"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 15 пройден","sub":"Урок 15 из 24 · Юнит 4","items":["Я могу спросить what, where, when, who и why.","Я могу спросить how many, how much и how often.","Я могу ответить с because."]}]}
